msgid "Build an independent Source SDK consumer"
msgstr "构建独立的 Source SDK 消费工程"

msgid ""
"This tutorial verifies that an independent C and C++ project can consume a "
"relocated Nexus Source SDK. It runs on a Linux host with Python 3.11+, CMake"
" 3.31+, Ninja, a C/C++ compiler and Git. It does not flash or execute an "
"MCU."
msgstr ""
"本教程验证独立 C 和 C++ 工程能够消费搬移后的 Nexus Source SDK。需要 Linux 主机、Python 3.11+、CMake "
"3.31+、Ninja、C/C++ 编译器和 Git。本教程不刷写或执行 MCU。"

msgid ""
"First obtain the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](../guides/source-"
"checkout.md). The following commands run from that checkout, not an "
"arbitrary default branch."
msgstr ""
"先取得[固定源码与递归依赖](../guides/source-checkout.md)。以下命令从该 checkout 执行，不能使用任意默认分支。"

msgid "Run the maintained complete consumer"
msgstr "执行维护中的完整消费者"

msgid ""
"Work from the repository root with the pinned recursive dependencies "
"initialized. Keep output outside the source checkout. This exact test calls "
"the production packager and maintained consumer template, moves the prefix "
"into a path containing spaces, configures independent projects, builds both "
"languages and runs the Native executables:"
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录执行，先初始化锁定的递归依赖。输出置于源码 checkout "
"外。下面这个确切测试调用生产打包器和维护中的消费者模板，将前缀搬移到含空格的路径，配置独立工程，构建两种语言并运行 Native 可执行文件："

msgid ""
"Success is a nonempty unittest execution ending in `OK`, with exit code "
"zero. The test's temporary directory is removed automatically. Failure "
"preserves its actual command diagnostic; do not count a missing compiler as "
"a passed consumer. The fixture deliberately packages a development snapshot "
"and explicitly opts in; this validates consumption, not a publishable "
"software candidate."
msgstr ""
"成功要求非空 unittest 执行以 `OK` "
"结束，退出码为零。测试自动清理临时目录。失败保留实际命令诊断；编译器缺失不能记作消费者通过。夹具明确打包开发快照并显式允许消费；这验证消费流程，不建立可发布软件候选。"

msgid ""
"The complete consumer is maintained in the production verifier rather than "
"copied into this page. These literal inputs are the same templates exercised"
" by the test:"
msgstr "完整消费者由生产验证器维护，本页不复制实现。以下真实输入就是该测试执行的模板："

msgid ""
"Maintained Native/F407/F470 consumer preparation; template code is not a "
"shell command."
msgstr "维护中的 Native/F407/F470 消费者准备；模板代码不是 shell 命令。"

msgid "Prepare a publishable prefix"
msgstr "准备可发布的前缀"

msgid ""
"From an initialized, clean, committed checkout, choose a new owned output "
"path:"
msgstr "从已初始化、干净且已提交的 checkout 开始，选择自己拥有的新输出路径："

msgid ""
"Move the entire prefix, including its identity and licenses, before "
"consumption. The [Source SDK contract](../design/source-compatibility.md) "
"defines version and interface epoch checks. Missing, extra, modified or "
"symlinked payload files reject configuration. A package made with "
"`--development-fixture` remains nonpublishable and requires "
"`NEXUS_ALLOW_SOURCE_SDK_FIXTURE=ON` in its consumer. Never use that opt-in "
"to bypass release qualification."
msgstr ""
"消费前搬移整个前缀，包括身份和许可。[Source SDK 合同](../design/source-compatibility.md)定义版本与接口 "
"epoch 检查。内容文件缺失、额外、修改或符号链接文件会拒绝配置。使用 `--development-fixture` "
"生成的包保持不可发布，消费者必须显式设置 `NEXUS_ALLOW_SOURCE_SDK_FIXTURE=ON`。不得用该选项绕过发布资格。"

msgid ""
"The formal installed-prefix verifier requires the locked ARM compiler on "
"`PATH` in addition to host tools. It builds Native C/C++ and the maintained "
"MCU consumers:"
msgstr ""
"正式安装前缀验证器除主机工具外，还要求锁定的 ARM 编译器位于 `PATH`。它构建 Native C/C++ 和维护中的 MCU 消费者："

msgid "Choose a product assembly"
msgstr "选择产品装配"

msgid ""
"Products keep `assembly.toml`, `main`, workers and private Board data in an "
"external repository. They consume `Nexus::Platform` through "
"`nexus_add_firmware()`; the helper does not generate an application or start"
" a scheduler. Use the [assembly "
"reference](../reference/configuration/assembly.md) to select reviewed "
"bindings and the [factory explanation](../explanation/factory.md) to obtain "
"faces. Public product examples live in [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)."
msgstr ""
"产品在外部仓库维护 `assembly.toml`、`main`、执行任务和私有 Board 数据。通过 `nexus_add_firmware()` "
"消费 "
"`Nexus::Platform`；该辅助函数不生成应用或启动调度器。使用[装配参考](../reference/configuration/assembly.md)选择复核绑定，通过[factory"
" 说明](../explanation/factory.md)取得接口面。公开产品示例位于 [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)。"

msgid ""
"![Source SDK preparation, relocation and independent consumer "
"verification](../assets/diagrams/source-sdk-consumer.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Source SDK 准备、搬移与独立消费者验证](../assets/diagrams/source-sdk-consumer.svg)"

msgid ""
"Source SDK preparation, relocation and independent consumer verification"
msgstr "Source SDK 准备、搬移与独立消费者验证"

msgid ""
"FIG-10 shows the current software consumption flow. Runtime and MCU link "
"evidence remain separate from [physical "
"qualification](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)."
msgstr ""
"FIG-10 表示当前软件消费流程。Runtime 与 MCU "
"链接证据和[物理资格](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)分别记录。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:69
msgid ""
"Check `verification.json`, every recorded exit code, Native runtime results,"
" MCU ELF/BIN/map and resource reports. MCU linking does not execute "
"hardware. The verifier's output is owned; an unrelated existing directory "
"rejects replacement. The SDK prefix and output must be canonical paths "
"without symlink aliases, and neither may contain the other. A rejected path "
"leaves SDK bytes and previous reports untouched; read the failure diagnostic"
" on stderr. An admitted owned output is cleared before the next attempt. "
"Remove only outputs you created after retaining required evidence."
msgstr ""
"检查 `verification.json`、每个记录的退出码、Native 运行结果、MCU ELF/BIN/map 与资源报告。MCU "
"链接不执行硬件。验证器输出为专有目录；不相关的已有目录会拒绝替换。SDK "
"前缀与输出必须是没有符号链接别名的规范路径，且两者均不得包含另一方。路径被拒绝时，SDK 字节和既有报告保持不变；失败诊断写入 "
"stderr。通过准入的专有输出会在下一次尝试前清空。仅在保留所需证据后删除自己创建的输出。"

msgid "Recover delivery without moving an existing tag"
msgstr "恢复交付并保持既有标签不变"

msgid ""
"Release maintainers normally use the same commit for SDK source and the "
"delivery workflow. If only delivery tooling needs repair after the source "
"has been tagged, keep that tag fixed. The `recover_tagged_source` input "
"defaults to `false`; only an explicit recovery with `publish=true` allows "
"the tagged source and the current `main` workflow builder to differ. "
"Same-source runs do not require `builder_ci_run_id`."
msgstr ""
"发布维护者通常对 SDK 源码和交付工作流使用同一提交。源码建立标签后，若仅需修复交付工具，必须保持该标签不变。"
"`recover_tagged_source` 输入默认为 `false`；只有显式选择恢复并设置 `publish=true`，"
"才允许已标签源码与当前 `main` 工作流构建器使用不同提交。同源运行无需 `builder_ci_run_id`。"

msgid ""
"Before recovery, open this repository's **Settings → Secrets and variables → "
"Actions → New repository secret** and create `NEXUS_RELEASE_TOKEN`. Use an "
"approved credential restricted to this repository with Actions read, Contents "
"write and Workflows write permissions. See the [publishing contract]"
"(https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#publishing-credentials) "
"for token types, expiry and approval. Enter the value only in GitHub's secret "
"field; never send it in chat. Connecting GitHub to the assistant does not create "
"this Actions secret."
msgstr ""
"恢复前，打开该仓库的 **Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret**，"
"创建 `NEXUS_RELEASE_TOKEN`。使用经批准且仅限本仓库的凭据，授予 Actions 读、Contents 写和 Workflows 写权限。"
"凭据类型、有效期和批准要求见[发布合同]"
"(https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#publishing-credentials)。"
"仅在 GitHub 的 secret 输入框填写凭据值；不得通过聊天发送。将 GitHub 连接到助手并不会创建该 Actions secret。"

msgid ""
"Recovery rejects a missing secret before SDK work. This check proves only that "
"the secret is configured, not that its permissions, approval or expiry are "
"valid. Only the final recovery publication step uses it; SDK preparation, "
"downloads and attestation retain the built-in workflow credentials. An ordinary "
"publication from one source and builder commit always uses the built-in token."
msgstr ""
"恢复流程在 SDK 工作前拒绝缺少 secret 的运行。此检查仅证明 secret 已配置，不能证明其权限、批准状态或有效期符合要求。"
"仅恢复流程的最终发布步骤使用该凭据；SDK 准备、下载与证明继续使用内置工作流凭据。"
"源码与构建器使用同一提交的普通发布始终使用内置 token。"

msgid ""
"From the repository root, use an authenticated GitHub CLI with Actions "
"write permission. Set `NEXUS_RELEASE_SOURCE` to the tagged 40-character "
"source commit. Set `NEXUS_CI_RUN_ID` to its successful full CI run on "
"`main` and `NEXUS_BUILDER_CI_RUN_ID` to the successful full CI run for "
"the current `main` builder. Both runs must have been created within the "
"last 24 hours; source CI cannot qualify a different builder. After each "
"delivery-tool repair, select the new builder's CI run, keeping the source "
"commit and tag unchanged. Then dispatch:"
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录操作，使用已认证且具备 Actions 写权限的 GitHub CLI。将 `NEXUS_RELEASE_SOURCE` "
"设为已标签的 40 字符源码提交，将 `NEXUS_CI_RUN_ID` 设为在 `main` 上针对该源码成功执行的完整 CI 运行编号，"
"将 `NEXUS_BUILDER_CI_RUN_ID` 设为当前 `main` 构建器成功执行的完整 CI 运行编号。"
"两次运行均须在过去 24 小时内创建；源码 CI 不能为不同的构建器建立资格。"
"每次修复交付工具后，选择新构建器的 CI 运行，保持源码提交与标签不变。然后触发工作流："

msgid ""
"The workflow derives the builder from its actual `main` workflow and "
"checkout. Recovery requires identical source and builder version-policy "
"bytes, the existing tag pointing to the source, and the live `main` "
"reference pointing to the builder. The SDK, documentation and source CI retain "
"the tagged source identity; the delivery receipt records the builder "
"separately. Policy mismatches reject admission, and both references are "
"checked before and after asset uploads."
msgstr ""
"工作流根据实际 `main` 工作流与 checkout 确定构建器。恢复要求源码与构建器的版本策略字节完全相同、"
"既有标签指向该源码、实时 `main` 引用指向该构建器。SDK、文档和源码 CI 保持已标签源码的身份，"
"交付记录另行标明构建器。策略不一致时拒绝准入；资产上传前后均复核这两个引用。"

msgid ""
"Keep every original evidence file when repairing packaging limits. Do not "
"move the tag, omit evidence or substitute a different source CI run to "
"obtain success. A dispatch alone does not establish publication: inspect "
"the completed workflow, release manifest and assets, then independently "
"download and verify the SDK. Recovery does not establish physical HIL or "
"production qualification."
msgstr ""
"修复打包限制时保留全部原始证据文件。不得为了获得成功而移动标签、删去证据或换用不同源码的 CI 运行。"
"仅触发工作流不能证明已发布：必须检查完成的工作流、发布清单与资产，再独立下载并验证 SDK。"
"恢复不建立物理 HIL 或生产资格。"
